FROM dustynv/ros:humble-ros-base-l4t-r32.7.1@sha256:110e55a4671fd90ad47dc1ab19fd67a98c780307e38ba4a4acc3c5efe317adc1

SHELL ["/bin/bash", "-c"]
ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive

ARG TRT_PYTHON_DEB=python3-libnvinfer_8.0.1-1+cuda10.2_arm64.deb
ARG TRT_PYTHON_SHA256=33733fa94ebeaa8a114140a0ee3485b7982c067adad09f93a0f9a157870608ed
RUN curl -fsSL -o /tmp/trt.deb \
        "https://repo.download.nvidia.com/jetson/common/pool/main/t/tensorrt/${TRT_PYTHON_DEB}" && \
    echo "${TRT_PYTHON_SHA256}  /tmp/trt.deb" | sha256sum -c - && \
    dpkg-deb -x /tmp/trt.deb /opt/tensorrt-python && \
    rm /tmp/trt.deb
ENV PYTHONPATH=/opt/tensorrt-python/usr/lib/python3.6/dist-packages
ENV LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libgomp.so.1

COPY requirements/vision-jetson.lock /tmp/vision.lock
RUN pip3 install --no-cache-dir --no-deps --require-hashes -r /tmp/vision.lock && \
    rm /tmp/vision.lock

RUN printf 'source /opt/ros/%s/install/setup.bash\n' "$ROS_DISTRO" > /opt/ros/${ROS_DISTRO}/setup.bash

COPY aims_ws/src/vision/ /app/aims_ws/src/vision/
WORKDIR /app/aims_ws
RUN source /opt/ros/${ROS_DISTRO}/setup.bash && \
    colcon build --packages-up-to vision_bringup && \
    rm -rf build/ log/

COPY aims_ws/src/fastdds_profile.xml /app/aims_ws/src/fastdds_profile.xml

COPY docker/ros2/entrypoint.sh /entrypoint.sh
RUN sed -i 's/\r$//' /entrypoint.sh && chmod +x /entrypoint.sh

RUN printf '#!/bin/bash\nexec /entrypoint.sh /opt/ros/%s/install/bin/ros2 "$@"\n' "$ROS_DISTRO" > /usr/local/bin/ros2 && \
    chmod +x /usr/local/bin/ros2

ENV RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_fastrtps_cpp
ENV FASTRTPS_DEFAULT_PROFILES_FILE=/app/aims_ws/src/fastdds_profile.xml
ENV ROS_DOMAIN_ID=5
ENV VISION_BACKEND=tensorrt
ENV VISION_DEVICE=cuda:0

VOLUME ["/app/models"]

ENTRYPOINT ["/entrypoint.sh"]
CMD ["ros2", "launch", "vision_bringup", "vision.launch.py"]
